{"strongs": "H4393", "word": "מְלֹא", "translit": "me.lo", "root": "מיץ", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "fulness, that which fills", "definition": "מְלֹא , [ מְלוֺא ] noun masculine Isa 8 Isa 1:4 fulness, that which fills (Arabic Lane 2729 ); — ׳ מ construct Gen 48:19 + 19 t.; מְלוֺ Ezek 41:8 suffix מְלוֺאוֺ Isa 42:10 + 3 t.; מְלוֺאָהּ Deut 33:16 + 12 t.; — 1. fulness of hand (= handful) Eccl 4:6 (twice in verse) followed by accusative of material חָפְנֵיכֶם פִּיחַ ׳ מ Exod 9:8 compare Lev 16:12 ; 1Kgs 17:12 so homer-full of manna; Exod 16:33 compare Lev 16:12 ; Num 22:18 ; Num 24:13 ; Judg 6:38 simil. מְלֹא בְגְדוֺ 2Kgs 4:39 rarely followed by מִן Lev 2:2 ; Lev 5:12 , compare Exod 16:32 (but read perhaps מִלְאוּ so ᵐ5 ⅏ see Di ). 2. mass of shepherds Isa 31:4 (in sim); multitude of nations Gen 48:19 (compare Arabic Qor 2:247 and elsewhere) 3. fullness = that which fills, entire contents , of אֶרֶץ Deut 33:16 ; Ps 24:1 ; Isa 6:3 ; Isa 8:8 ; Isa 34:1 ; Mic 1:2 ; Jer 8:16 ; Jer 47:2 ; Ezek 12:19 ; Ezek 19:7 ; Ezek 30:12 ; Ezek 32:15 תֵּבֵל Ps 50:12 ; Ps 89:12 יָם Isa 42:10 ; 1Chr 16:32 ; Ps 96:11 ; Ps 98:7 עִיר Amos 6:8 . 4. phrases: — קוֺמָתוֺ ׳ מ = at full length 1Sam 28:20 full line , or portion הַחֶ֫בַל ׳ מ 2Sam 8:2 הַקָּנֶה ׳ מ Ezek 41:8 full rod (reed).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4650')\">BDB4650</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4393')\">H4393</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4649')\">BDB4649</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4651')\">BDB4651</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מְלֹא</bdbheb>, [<bdbheb>מְלוֺא</bdbheb>] <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8</ref></sup><ref ref=\"Isa 1:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,4)\">Isa 1:4</ref> <highlightword>fulness, that which fills</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder2987/> <lookup onclick=\